<!--
    Three nodes joined by two bars — the usual share glyph.

    Drawn here rather than taken from a Material icon package, like the rest of the set: see
    ic_saved_games.xml for why.

    The first attempt placed the nodes with android:translateY on the paths. That attribute only
    exists on <group>, so it was silently ignored and the top node — centred at y=2 with radius 3 —
    was clipped by the top of the viewport. Everything here is stated in final coordinates instead,
    and a generator checked the bounding box lands inside 0..24 on both axes.
-->
